cat":"Major","title":"Over 43 million Americans vote early ahead of Nov. 3 midterms","summary":"Early voting is running nearly 10 million ahead of 2022, with Texas up about 50% and South Carolina up 83%. Tuesday's elections will decide control of Congress.","source":"Global News (AP)","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12127307/us-midterm-early-voting-numbers/","published":"2026-10-30"},{"id":"n4","cat":"World","title":"Poland's constitutional court dispute escalates; president cuts trip short","summary":"President Karol Nawrocki returned early from Senegal after the tribunal's president was suspended and another judge claimed its leadership, which the court called a 'coup d'\u00e9tat.' Riot police were deployed outside the court.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/30/polish-president-turns-back-mid-flight-amid-coup-detat-allegations","published":"2026-10-31"},{"id":"n5","cat":"Canada","title":"Canada and EU sign broad partnership at Montreal summit","summary":"The agreement covers trade, critical minerals, energy, security and linking instant-payment systems, and opens talks on Canada joining Erasmus+. Canada also signalled it will join the EU's Ukraine Support Loan.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12127600/canada-eu-alliance/","published":"2026-10-30"},{"id":"n6","cat":"Business","title":"Intel shares plunge 28.6%, worst day since 1974","summary":"Intel guided Q4 revenue to $15-16 billion, about 9% below estimates, with adjusted EPS of 25 cents vs. 43 cents expected, citing weak PC demand into mid-2027.","source":"Stocktitan","url":"https://www.stocktitan.net/articles/stock-market-today-live-october-30-2026","published":"2026-10-30"},{"id":"n7","cat":"AI","title":"OpenAI reportedly trims fundraising target to about $20B","summary":"Per the FT, OpenAI cut its round from $30 billion at a $1.4 trillion valuation to about $20 billion at $1.25 trillion, amid a roughly 10% three-week slide in the Nasdaq 100.","source":"CoinDesk","url":"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/30/openai-reportedly-cuts-fundraising-target-amid-ai-jitters","published":"2026-10-30"},{"id":"n8","cat":"World","title":"US approves $2.1B deal for 500 Patriot missiles for Ukraine","summary":"Zelenskyy welcomed the PAC-3 package but warned deliveries could take years, urging partners to send existing stocks now and replenish them later.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/31/zelenskyy-thanks-us-over-deal-for-500-patriot-missiles-but-warns-delivery-could-take-years","published":"2026-10-31"},{"id":"n9","cat":"Canada","title":"Canada's economy stalled again in August","summary":"Statistics Canada said real GDP was essentially unchanged in August, as wholesale trade fell 1.4%. Its early estimate shows a 0.1% decline in September.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12127155/canada-gdp-data-august-2026/","published":"2026-10-30"},{"id":"n10","cat":"AI","title":"Anthropic expected to get 'high junk' credit rating after IPO","summary":"Per the FT, Blackstone, anchor of a $63 billion chip-financing deal, now expects a double-B rating, reversing earlier hopes for investment grade before 2027. Anthropic filed for its IPO this week.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/30/anthropic-expected-to-receive-high-junk-rating-from-credit-agencies-following-ipo-report-says/","published":"2026-10-30"},{"id":"n11","cat":"World","title":"North Korea fires about 12 ballistic missiles as Seoul seeks talks","summary":"South Korea said roughly 12 short-range missiles were launched from near Wonsan and flew about 250 km. Pyongyang has not answered Seoul's proposal for border talks.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/30/north-korea-warns-south-korea-with-ballistic-missiles-as-seoul-calls-for-talks-to-ease-bor","published":"2026-10-30"},{"id":"n12","cat":"Canada","title":"Analysis challenges military's account of deadly Wainwright fire","summary":"A Global News satellite and weather analysis questions the military's description of the Oct. 17 CFB Wainwright fire as 'entirely anomalous'; 4 soldiers died and 39 were injured.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12127761/wainwright-satellite-fire-analysis/","published":"2026-10-31"},{"id":"n13","cat":"Business","title":"Big Tech AI spending commitments top $3 trillion","summary":"Bloomberg tallies more than $3 trillion in future data-centre, lease and equipment commitments from Alphabet, Meta, Microsoft, Amazon and Oracle, up from about $2.4 trillion in July.","source":"The Next Web","url":"https://thenextweb.com/news/big-tech-3-trillion-ai-spending-commitments","published":"2026-10-30"},{"id":"n14","cat":"AI","title":"Trojanized Claude Code extension hit up to 5,000 Cursor users","summary":"A malicious version 2.1.313 on Cursor's marketplace installed an SSH backdoor on Oct. 29; it was removed and Anthropic published a clean 2.1.314.","source":"The Hacker News","url":"https://thehackernews.com/2026/10/official-claude-code-vs-code-extension.html","published":"2026-10-30"},{"id":"n15","cat":"Major","title":"Google's first data-centre satellite comes online in orbit","summary":"Google's Suncatcher prototype, carrying four TPUs and up to 1 kW of power, completed about three weeks of checks. Two more satellites are planned for 2027.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/30/googles-first-data-center-satellite-is-online-and-writing-poetry/","published":"2026-10-30"},{"id":"n16","cat":"Canada","title":"Hockey Canada seeks clarity after ruling reinstating Russia","summary":"CAS ordered the IIHF to reinstate Russia, affecting five 2027 events including the world juniors in Alberta starting Dec. 26. Ottawa said it strongly opposes the decision.","source":"Global News (CP)","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12127311/hockey-canada-seeks-clarity-on-russias-return/","published":"2026-10-30"},{"id":"n17","cat":"World","title":"France deploys 70,000 police for Halloween protests","summary":"Protests over school conditions and the cost of living enter a third weekend; city-centre demonstrations are banned and Paris has imposed curfews in some districts.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/31/france-to-deploy-70000-security-personnel-as-it-prepares-for-halloween-protests","published":"2026-10-31"},{"id":"n18","cat":"AI","title":"Nearly 2 in 3 U.S. teens and tweens use AI chatbots, studies find","summary":"Surveys by Common Sense Media and the JED Foundation found wide chatbot use, including for companionship; use during distress was linked to poorer mental health, though not shown to cause it.","source":"NPR Illinois","url":"https://www.nprillinois.org/2026-10-30/nearly-2-out-of-3-teens-and-tweens-use-ai-chatbots-new-research-shows","published":"2026-10-30"}]}